  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="inicio">
      <div class="hero-copy reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Comprehensive dentistry · Ciudad Satélite</p>
        <h1>Expert care for your oral health.<br><em>We care for your smile.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">Preventive, cosmetic and restorative dentistry in one place. A team that listens and supports you with a personalized care plan.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="https://wa.me/525534360587" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book your consultation <span>↗</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="#servicios">Explore our treatments <span>↓</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-row">
          <div class="avatars"><b>D</b><b>C</b><b>S</b></div>
          <p><strong>Specialized care</strong><br>for every stage of your smile</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual reveal delay">
        <div class="image-frame">
          <img src="/assets/hero.webp" srcset="/assets/hero-900.webp 900w, /assets/hero.webp 1691w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) calc(100vw - 44px), 49vw" width="1691" height="930" alt="Smiling patient at Consultorio Dental Satélite" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high">
          <div class="image-caption"><span>01</span><p>Clear diagnosis.<br>Precise treatment.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="floating-card">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21c4.6-3.1 7-7.2 7-12.1C19 5.1 16.9 3 14.2 3c-1 0-1.7.4-2.2 1-.5-.6-1.2-1-2.2-1C7.1 3 5 5.1 5 8.9 5 13.8 7.4 17.9 12 21Z"/></svg>
          <div><strong>Your well-being comes first</strong><small>A plan designed for you</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="promise">
      <p>DENTISTRY WITH PURPOSE</p>
      <h2>We love to see you smile.<br>It is part of <em>who you are.</em></h2>
      <div class="promise-grid">
        <p>We bring different areas of dentistry together to support you at every stage of treatment. We begin with a clinical assessment and explain your options based on your needs.</p>
        <a href="#nosotros">Our approach <span>→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services" id="servicios">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Treatments</p><h2>Solutions to help you smile<br>with confidence.</h2></div>
        <p>From prevention to full-mouth rehabilitation, we develop a clear, personalized plan for you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-grid">
        <article class="service-card featured">
          <div class="service-num">01</div><h3>Smile design</h3><p>A cosmetic plan in harmony with your facial features.</p>
          <details><summary>About this treatment</summary><p>We assess your teeth, gums and bite to develop a plan that may include whitening, orthodontics, restorations, veneers or implants.</p></details>
          <a href="https://wa.me/525534360587?text=Hello%2C%20I%20would%20like%20information%20about%20smile%20design." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask us on WhatsApp <span>↗</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="service-num">02</div><h3>Dental implants</h3><p>An option for replacing missing teeth.</p>
          <details><summary>About this treatment</summary><p>Titanium implants are placed in the jawbone to restore function without reshaping adjacent teeth. A consultation helps determine whether they are suitable for you.</p></details>
          <a href="https://wa.me/525534360587?text=Hello%2C%20I%20would%20like%20information%20about%20dental%20implants." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask us on WhatsApp <span>↗</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="service-num">03</div><h3>Prevention and diagnosis</h3><p>Caring for your smile starts with understanding your oral health.</p>
          <details><summary>About this treatment</summary><p>We examine your teeth, gums, bite, jaw joint and oral tissues, using photographs and additional tests when needed. We provide guidance on brushing, flossing, fluoride and sealants.</p></details>
          <a href="https://wa.me/525534360587?text=Hello%2C%20I%20would%20like%20information%20about%20prevention%20and%20diagnosis." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask us on WhatsApp <span>↗</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="service-num">04</div><h3>Oral surgery</h3><p>Surgical care tailored to your needs.</p>
          <details><summary>About this treatment</summary><p>Depending on your clinical assessment, we offer wisdom tooth extractions, implant placement, bone preservation and augmentation, bone regeneration and gum procedures.</p></details>
          <a href="https://wa.me/525534360587?text=Hello%2C%20I%20would%20like%20information%20about%20oral%20surgery." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask us on WhatsApp <span>↗</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="service-num">05</div><h3>Orthodontics</h3><p>Straighter teeth and a balanced bite.</p>
          <details><summary>About this treatment</summary><p>We offer braces and Invisalign clear aligners. After assessing your case, we explain which treatment option best suits your needs.</p></details>
          <a href="https://wa.me/525534360587?text=Hello%2C%20I%20would%20like%20information%20about%20orthodontics." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask us on WhatsApp <span>↗</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="service-num">06</div><h3>Root canal treatment</h3><p>Treatment to help preserve your natural tooth.</p>
          <details><summary>About this treatment</summary><p>We clean and seal the inside of a damaged or infected tooth to address the cause of pain and help preserve the tooth.</p></details>
          <a href="https://wa.me/525534360587?text=Hello%2C%20I%20would%20like%20information%20about%20root%20canal%20treatment." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask us on WhatsApp <span>↗</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="service-num">07</div><h3>Dental prosthetics</h3><p>Restore function when eating, speaking and smiling.</p>
          <details><summary>About this treatment</summary><p>Dental prosthetics can replace one or more missing teeth or restore damaged teeth. We recommend a restorative option based on your assessment.</p></details>
          <a href="https://wa.me/525534360587?text=Hello%2C%20I%20would%20like%20information%20about%20dental%20prosthetics." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask us on WhatsApp <span>↗</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about" id="nosotros">
      <div class="about-image reveal"><img src="/assets/team.webp" srcset="/assets/team-800.webp 800w, /assets/team.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1600" height="1200" alt="The Consultorio Dental Satélite team at the practice" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>You are in caring hands.</span></div>
      <div class="about-copy reveal delay">
        <p class="eyebrow light"><span></span> What defines us</p>
        <h2>Clinical excellence.<br><em>A personal approach.</em></h2>
        <p>Meet our dental care team. We pay attention to every detail to offer a professional, personal dental experience.</p>
        <div class="stats"><div><strong>Comprehensive</strong><span>Different areas of dentistry in one place</span></div><div><strong>Personalized</strong><span>Plans tailored to your needs</span></div></div>
        <a class="button button-light" href="#equipo">Meet the team <span>→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="team-section" id="equipo">
      <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Our team</p><h2>Meet the people<br>caring for your smile.</h2></div><p>Professionals who support you with personal attention and a plan designed for you.</p></div>
      <div class="team-grid">
<article class="team-card"><div class="doctor-photo-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Space reserved for the clinician’s photograph"></div><p class="team-role">Dentist in charge</p><h3>Lourdes Carrillo Rojas</h3><p>Dental surgeon</p><p class="credential">Professional license 1624170 · UNAM</p></article>
<article class="team-card"><div class="doctor-photo-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Space reserved for the clinician’s photograph"></div><p class="team-role">Clinical team</p><h3>Karen Jiménez Marquez</h3><p>Degree in dentistry</p><p class="credential">Professional license 11940440 · UCAD</p></article>
<article class="team-card"><div class="doctor-photo-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Space reserved for the clinician’s photograph"></div><p class="team-role">Clinical team</p><h3>Xóchitl Felix Roldán</h3><p>Dental surgeon</p><p class="credential">Professional license 15202278 · UNAM</p></article>
<article class="team-card"><div class="doctor-photo-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Space reserved for the clinician’s photograph"></div><p class="team-role">Clinical team</p><h3>Juan Carlos Cervantes Riquelme</h3><p>Dental surgeon</p><p class="credential">Professional license 9822972 · UNITEC</p></article>
<article class="team-card"><div class="doctor-photo-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Space reserved for the clinician’s photograph"></div><p class="team-role">Clinical team</p><h3>Iván Barrera Hernández</h3><p>Dental surgeon</p><p class="credential">Professional license 5864972</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="technology" id="tecnologia">
      <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Technology</p><h2>Tools for<br>precise care.</h2></div><p>Digital tools that help us assess your case and plan your treatment.</p></div>
      <div class="digital-grid">
        <article class="technology-copy"><span>01 · Digital imaging</span><h3>Digital X-rays</h3><p>Our digital X-ray system captures images of your teeth and displays them directly on a computer to support the clinical assessment.</p></article>
        <article class="technology-copy"><span>02 · Digital models</span><h3>Intraoral scanner</h3><p>We create digital models of your mouth to share with the dental laboratory and support treatments that require them.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="about clinic-section" id="consultorio">
      <div class="about-image"><picture><source media="(max-width: 560px)" srcset="/assets/reception-mobile.webp"><img src="/assets/reception-1440.webp" width="1440" height="1080" alt="Consultorio Dental Satélite reception, with a blue wall and welcome desk" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture></div>
      <div class="about-copy"><p class="eyebrow light"><span></span> Our practice</p><h2>A place to<br><em>feel at ease.</em></h2><p>We welcome you to our Ciudad Satélite practice, where we listen to your needs and support you throughout your dental care.</p><a class="button button-light" href="#contacto">Plan your visit <span>↓</span></a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="experience" id="experiencia">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Your experience</p>
      <div class="quote-mark">“</div>
      <blockquote>We want you to feel heard,<br>comfortable and in caring hands.</blockquote>
      <div class="steps">
        <div><b>01</b><h3>We listen</h3><p>We learn about your needs, questions and goals.</p></div>
        <div><b>02</b><h3>We assess</h3><p>A thorough assessment supported by modern technology.</p></div>
        <div><b>03</b><h3>We plan</h3><p>A clear treatment plan tailored to you.</p></div>
        <div><b>04</b><h3>We support</h3><p>Personal follow-up before, during and after treatment.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact-section" id="contacto">
      <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Visit us</p><h2>Find us in<br>Ciudad Satélite.</h2></div><p>Contact us to check availability and book your consultation.</p></div>
      <div class="contact-grid">
        <div><h3>Address</h3><address>Circuito Historiadores S 44, Local 3<br>Ciudad Satélite, Naucalpan<br>Estado de México, C.P. 53100</address><a class="text-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Consultorio%20Dental%20Sat%C3%A9lite%20Circuito%20Historiadores%20S%2044%20Naucalpan" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get directions <span>↗</span></a></div>
        <div><h3>Appointments and contact</h3><p>Phone: <a href="tel:+525553938629">55 5393 8629</a><br>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/525534360587" target="_blank" rel="noopener">55 3436 0587</a></p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/consultorio_dental_satelite/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Follow us on Instagram <span>↗</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <iframe class="contact-map" title="Consultorio Dental Satélite location on Google Maps" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Consultorio%20Dental%20Sat%C3%A9lite%20Circuito%20Historiadores%20S%2044%20Naucalpan&amp;output=embed" width="1200" height="420" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section">
      <div><p class="eyebrow light"><span></span> Take the first step</p><h2>Your new smile<br>starts here.</h2></div>
      <div><p>Book a consultation to explore the right treatment for you.</p><a class="button button-white" href="https://wa.me/525534360587" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book via WhatsApp <span>↗</span></a></div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    import "../../scripts/site.js";
  </script>
</SiteLayout>
